             <item>
              <widget class="QTextBrowser" name="textBrowser_4">
               <property name="styleSheet">
                <string notr="true"> font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6; /* 增加行间距，防止文字堆叠 */</string>
               </property>
               <property name="html">
                <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei UI','sans-serif'; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;If you plan to test and evaluate the effectiveness of a certain control strategy, please start by focusing on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Policy Validation&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;Set the initial state of the rocket and the interference conditions in  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Option&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt; , and then you can view the recovery animation and related data in the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt; &amp;quot;Simulation&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt; . &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;justify&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;Secondly, you can focus on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Data Analysis&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;. Through Monte Carlo simulation in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Collection&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;, you can obtain evaluation indicators. In &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Evaluation&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt; , you can view the specific indicators of a certain strategy in a particular environment. In &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Comparison&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt; , you can analyze the advantages of the strategy and the impact of the environment on it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
               </property>
              </widget>
             </item>
            </layout>
           </widget>
          </item>
